&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Sony Interactive Entertainment?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment isn’t just the Best Place to Play — it’s also the Best Place to Work. Sony Interactive Entertainment (SIE) is the company behind the PlayStation brand. As a subsidiary of Sony Group Corporation, we’re part of a proud legacy of innovation and excellence. SIE is a dynamic technology company, delivering cutting-edge hardware and network services to more than 100 million people and an entertainment leader, home to some of the most beloved and recognizable intellectual properties (IP) in the world. Our role at SIE is to create and nurture the experiences under the PlayStation brand, a name synonymous with entertainment excellence and creativity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;International Media Manager – LATAM&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;São Paulo, Brazil (Hybrid)&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;International Media Manager – LATAM&lt;/strong&gt; is the key bridge between Global Media and local marketing teams, ensuring global media strategies are translated into locally relevant, high-performing campaigns across Latin America, including with a focus on Brazil and CASSA (Central America &amp;amp; Spanish Speaking South America).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role acts as a trusted advisor and market advocate, representing LATAM needs within global planning while aligning local execution to global priorities. You will lead local media planning excellence, agency performance, and campaign delivery—driving measurable business impact across the PlayStation portfolio (Hardware, Software, Services, Peripherals, and Third-Party Marketing).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will partner closely with Global Media, Campaign Management, Analytics &amp;amp; Insights, and agency teams to deliver coordinated, insight-led, and commercially effective media activity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Main Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market Strategy &amp;amp; Campaign Delivery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate global media strategies into locally relevant plans and activations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead end-to-end campaign planning and execution across LATAM markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure campaigns are data-informed, on time, on budget, and aligned to KPIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a comprehensive view of the campaign portfolio, aligning audiences, channels, and investment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feed local insights into global planning to improve local relevance and impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agency &amp;amp; Partner Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead local media agency relationships, driving planning quality, performance, and accountability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve briefing, reporting, and optimization processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be responsible for agency performance, resourcing, and financial management (budgets, POs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong partnerships with local media owners and vendors to unlock value and innovation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measurement &amp;amp; Performance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: black !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Embed a test-and-learn, data-focused approach across all campaigns&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee post-campaign analysis and ensure actionable insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Analytics teams to optimize performance and inform future investment decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion data-informed planning and budgeting within the LATAM territory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration &amp;amp; Influence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a connector between Global and Local teams, aligning priorities and ways of working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate across international markets to share best practices and drive consistency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence partners across functions to deliver strong commercial outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liaise with the Brazilian and CASSA Commercial teams on Retail media activity&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key Performance Indicators&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivery of high-performing, locally relevant media campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong alignment between global strategy and local execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuous improvement in campaign performance and efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective agency management and stakeholder collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Requirements&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years’ experience in media, marketing, or advertising (entertainment, gaming, or tech preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English and Brazilian Portuguese (spoken and written), Spanish a bonus but not required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in Brazil, able to regularly attend the São Paulo office for team collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of the media and retail landscape across LATAM markets –Brazil and CASSA (Central America &amp;amp; Spanish Speaking South America), primarily Mexico.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working within global or regional marketing environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to lead media agencies (internally, within agency or externally managing) and cross-functional teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience delivering integrated, multi-channel campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in digital media (programmatic, paid social, search)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with campaign measurement, analytics, and optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and partner management skills, with the ability to influence across global teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized, with the ability to manage multiple priorities in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated AI proficiency, with the ability to effectively leverage AI to improve productivity, accelerate analysis, strengthen decision-making, and enhance the quality of work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Preferred Qualities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong market advocate mindset with ability to balance global and local priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical problem solver who can turn data into actionable insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative and adaptable, comfortable working across teams, cultures, and time zones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in entertainment, gaming, or culturally-led marketing, with an understanding of how brands connect with audiences through moments, communities, and content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for gaming, entertainment, and media&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please note, Sony Interactive Entertainment conducts background checks at the offer stage for all new employees (which may include criminal background checks for some roles) and will need to process personal information to support these checks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please refer to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.playstation.com/legal/careers-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for more information about what personal information we collect, how we use it, who we share it with, and your data protection rights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All persons will receive consideration for employment without regard to gender (including gender identity, gender expression and gender reassignment), race (including colour, nationality, ethnic or national origin), religion or belief, marital or civil partnership status, disability, age, sexual orientation, pregnancy, maternity or parental status, trade union membership or membership in any other legally protected category.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We strive to create an inclusive environment, empower employees and embrace diversity. We encourage everyone to respond.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment is a Fair Chance employer and qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records will be considered for employment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
